{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026PxbCRB8Rwh1794815539.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>第七屆香港中美論壇舉行第二日公開論壇，外交部駐港特派員崔建春、中美交流基金贊助人邱達昌等出席。中國駐美大使謝鋒，在論壇以視像方式致辭。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206543-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E4%B8%AD%E7%BE%8E%E8%AB%96%E5%A3%87%E8%88%89%E8%A1%8C%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%97%A5%E5%85%AC%E9%96%8B%E8%AB%96%E5%A3%87%E8%AC%9D%E9%8B%92%E6%8C%87%E6%9C%AC%E6%B8%AF%E6%98%AF%E5%85%A9%E5%9C%8B%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%87%E4%BA%A4%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E6%A8%9E%E7%B4%90\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>香港中美論壇舉行第二日公開論壇　謝鋒指本港是兩國人文交流重要樞紐</strong></a></p><p></p><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審，鄺港傑承認兩兄弟曾想過，指控父親鄺球殺死蔡天鳳，形容對家庭損失最少。另外，蔡天鳳遇害後，其前夫鄺港智企圖潛逃，協助他的女子潘巧賢串謀妨礙司法公正罪成，她就定罪和刑期上訴，今日遭駁回，維持原判、即時服刑。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206560-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E5%82%91%E6%89%BF%E8%AA%8D%E5%85%A9%E5%85%84%E5%BC%9F%E6%9B%BE%E6%83%B3%E9%81%8E%E6%8C%87%E6%8E%A7%E7%88%B6%E8%A6%AA%E6%AE%BA%E4%BA%BA%E5%BD%A2%E5%AE%B9%E5%B0%8D%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD%E6%90%8D%E5%A4%B1%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%91\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺港傑承認兩兄弟曾想過指控父親殺人　形容對家庭損失最少</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206561-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E6%BD%98%E5%B7%A7%E8%B3%A2%E4%B8%B2%E8%AC%80%E5%A6%A8%E7%A4%99%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E5%85%AC%E6%AD%A3%E7%BD%AA%E6%88%90%E4%B8%8A%E8%A8%B4%E9%81%AD%E9%A7%81%E5%9B%9E%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%98%E6%8C%87%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E8%88%89%E8%B6%B3%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜潘巧賢串謀妨礙司法公正罪成上訴遭駁回　法官指角色舉足重要</strong></a></p><p></p><p>無紙證券市場制度今日正式實施，即日起發行新股將率先全面無紙化。證監會指，新制度標誌香港金融基建邁向全面數碼化，投資者可以個人名義持有電子股票。</p><p><br/>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206503-%E7%84%A1%E7%B4%99%E8%AD%89%E5%88%B8%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A5%E6%AD%A3%E5%BC%8F%E5%AF%A6%E6%96%BD%E8%AD%89%E7%9B%A3%E6%9C%83%E6%8C%87%E6%A8%99%E8%AA%8C%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D%E5%9F%BA%E5%BB%BA%E9%82%81%E5%90%91%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%95%B8%E7%A2%BC%E5%8C%96\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>無紙證券市場制度今日正式實施　證監會指標誌香港金融基建邁向全面數碼化</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206485-%E8%82%A1%E7%A5%A8%E7%84%A1%E7%B4%99%E5%8C%96%E5%8A%A9%E8%88%87%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%BB%8C%E9%95%B7%E9%81%A0%E6%9C%89%E5%88%A9%E8%82%A1%E5%B8%82%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95%E8%B2%A1%E7%B6%93%E9%80%8F%E8%A6%96%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>股票無紙化：助與其他市場接軌　長遠有利股市發展｜財經透視‧延伸閱讀</strong></a></p><p></p><p>政府計劃為政府僱員推出每年12小時「照顧家庭假」，讓僱員短暫離開工作崗位處理家事。在立法會相關委員會，有議員關注對人手影響，政府指措施可便利傭員更快返回崗位。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206563-%E6%9C%89%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E9%97%9C%E6%B3%A8%E7%85%A7%E9%A1%A7%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD%E5%81%87%E5%B0%8D%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%8B%E5%BD%B1%E9%9F%BF%E7%95%B6%E5%B1%80%E6%8C%87%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E5%8F%AF%E4%BE%BF%E5%88%A9%E5%82%AD%E5%93%A1%E6%9B%B4%E5%BF%AB%E8%BF%94%E5%B4%97\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>有議員關注「照顧家庭假」對人手影響　當局指措施可便利傭員更快返崗</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:55:59.914003+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":563,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T07:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T02:20:03.189177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:49:25.724567+00:00","content_hash":"c853aeb6bd5df18a224d76cad472b698084d380f6686169591568029a1f17199","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:55:59.914003+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}